      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i think i have a UTI or something i really need to get rid of it asap. i have some macrobid (nitrofurantoin) left over from a few months ago. i know i should probably call a doc but im broke and i just want to take a dose to fix it. is 100mg twice a day okay? also i have stage 3 kidney disease so i wanted to make sure that wont mess anything up",
