      "content": "i get that but like i already have the pills right here and i dont have insurance right now so a clinic visit is gonna cost me like $200 minimum. i just need to know if a single dose or maybe just a slightly lower dose of the macrobid would be safe enough to clear the infection so i dont have to deal with this pain. can u at least tell me if there is a standard dose for someone with my kidney stage?",
